{"product_id":"vaporesso-zero-2-top-filling-pod-system","title":"Vaporesso Zero 2 Top Filling Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Vaporesso ZERO 2 Top-Fill Pod System, featuring an 800mAh battery and a revamped pod with a top-fill system for enhanced leakage prevention.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-renova-zero-pod-system\" title=\"Vaporesso Renova Zero Pod System\"\u003eVaporesso Renova Zero Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-zero-2-pod-system\" title=\"Vaporesso Zero 2 Vape\"\u003eVaporesso Zero 2 Pod System (Bottom Filling Pod)\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-renova-zero-pod-cartridge\" title=\"Vaporesso Renova Zero Pods\"\u003eVaporesso \u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eRenova \u003c\/span\u003eZero Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-zero-2-replacement-pods\" title=\"Vaporesso zero 2 replacement pods\"\u003eVaporesso Zero 2 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from a zinc-alloy material, the ZERO 2 offers a compact yet futuristic design and utilizes the AXON chipset for consistent vapor output. Take steady draws via draw-activation for a natural vaping experience and enjoy your favorite nicotine salts from this spaceship-esque pod system.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso ZERO 2 Top Fill Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 89mm x 31.8mm x 19mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Zinc-Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 1.0-1.3ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 800mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Port: USB Type-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutput: Direct Voltage\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperation: Draw-Activation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Top Press-To-Fill Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Material: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 3mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAXON Chipset\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Indicator\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo Load Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Voltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvertime Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvercharge Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Vaporesso ZERO 2 Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.0ohm ZERO S Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 USB Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531768045623,"sku":"V Zero 2 Top Filling Pod System","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_zero_2_top_fill_pod_system_-_carbon_fiber.png?v=1741709895","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-zero-2-top-filling-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




